{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steel Runner is a VR vehicle crafting sandbox game using physics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own unique Runner(vehicle) by combining various types of blocks, then ride it to enjoy free exploration, adventure, and combat in an open-world environment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this vast open-world, you will spawn with a small runner that you are initially given.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your runner to chop down trees, gather ores, and fight enemies to collect blocks, modifying and upgrading it to aim for the ultimate runner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At times, you may want to switch to a different runner, or your runner might get destroyed by enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But don\u2019t worry, as long as you have the materials, you can always summon your runner from the saved blueprint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create various amazing runners and make this vast open-world your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855870/extras/ScreenShot2_\u5c0f\u3055\u3044.png?t=1741180546\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Design and Construction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Runners can be created by combining 1 x 1 m blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create a vehicle body, attach tyres and... you're ready to move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are also numerous modules such as weapons, shields and batteries, so get creative with the placement to create your one and only runner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each combined block has its own HP, and blocks that can no longer be connected to the centre of the runner will drop out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your weak points hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a vast open-world built with multiple biomes, various terrains with differing elevations, and numerous points of interest (POIs)! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Depending on the design of your runner, you may find some terrains easier to drive than others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855870/extras/ScreenShot3_\u5c0f\u3055\u3044.png?t=1741180546\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players piloting their runners can use the controller to aim the weapons attached to their runner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize a variety of weapons such as cannons, lasers, missiles, and anti-aircraft guns to defeat your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhancing your runner's defense with armor and shields, or modifying the runner structure to create a more resistable design, is also crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855870/extras/ScreenShot4_\u5c0f\u3055\u3044.png?t=1741180546\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Powered by \u201cCRIWARE\u201d.CRIWARE is a trademark of CRI Middleware Co., Ltd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2855870?t=1741180546","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741180546","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855870/d69b2edf48391b11774c56c3abab886fecec2f05/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741180546","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855870/d69b2edf48391b11774c56c3abab886fecec2f05/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741180546","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3541640,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steel Runner is a VR vehicle crafting sandbox game using physics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own unique Runner(vehicle) by combining various types of blocks, then ride it to enjoy free exploration, adventure, and combat in an open-world environment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this vast open-world, you will spawn with a small runner that you are initially given.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your runner to chop down trees, gather ores, and fight enemies to collect blocks, modifying and upgrading it to aim for the ultimate runner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At times, you may want to switch to a different runner, or your runner might get destroyed by enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But don\u2019t worry, as long as you have the materials, you can always summon your runner from the saved blueprint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create various amazing runners and make this vast open-world your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855870/extras/ScreenShot2_\u5c0f\u3055\u3044.png?t=1741180546\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Design and Construction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Runners can be created by combining 1 x 1 m blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create a vehicle body, attach tyres and... you're ready to move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are also numerous modules such as weapons, shields and batteries, so get creative with the placement to create your one and only runner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each combined block has its own HP, and blocks that can no longer be connected to the centre of the runner will drop out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your weak points hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a vast open-world built with multiple biomes, various terrains with differing elevations, and numerous points of interest (POIs)! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Depending on the design of your runner, you may find some terrains easier to drive than others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855870/extras/ScreenShot3_\u5c0f\u3055\u3044.png?t=1741180546\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players piloting their runners can use the controller to aim the weapons attached to their runner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize a variety of weapons such as cannons, lasers, missiles, and anti-aircraft guns to defeat your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhancing your runner's defense with armor and shields, or modifying the runner structure to create a more resistable design, is also crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855870/extras/ScreenShot4_\u5c0f\u3055\u3044.png?t=1741180546\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Powered by \u201cCRIWARE\u201d.CRIWARE is a trademark of CRI Middleware Co., Ltd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Runner's Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855870/header.jpg?t=1741180546","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257086942,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257086942/movie480.mp4?t=1736257978","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257086942/movie_max.mp4?t=1736257978"},"name":"Steel Runner - Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257086942/0a47c54a730e5d3df576ba5cb52b2ac6f6873ad7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1736257978","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257086942/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1736257978","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257086942/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1736257978"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257086951,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257086951/movie480.mp4?t=1737029635","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257086951/movie_max.mp4?t=1737029635"},"name":"Steel Runner - Gameplay Trailer 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257086951/10db7870dc39359c565614254c36777a186d592b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1737029635","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257086951/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1737029635","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257086951/movie_max_vp9.webm